Comments:
Evaluated by Caleb Marshall 2025
1) Direct capture rate calculated using the spectroscopic factors of Banu 2012 and Lotay 2022.
2) Excitation energies from Basunia 2022, based on a least squares fit of Longfellow 2020, Wolf 2019, and Yoneda 2006.
3) Resonant parameters are taken from mirror spectroscopic factors of Lotay 2022 and shell model
calculations of that same work.
4) Matching temperature 1 GK.
